{"seq":3,"slug":"async-ecosystem","title":"异步生态系统：Rust 异步编程的工具全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/advanced/async-ecosystem","wordCount":1134,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"异步生态系统-rust-异步编程的工具全景\">异步生态系统：Rust 异步编程的工具全景</h1><p>Rust 异步生态经过多年发展，已形成相对成熟的技术栈。从运行时到 HTTP 框架、数据库驱动、消息队列客户端，各层都有高质量的开源实现。了解生态全貌有助于在项目中做出合理的技术选型，避免重复造轮子或选择不适合场景的工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Rust 异步生态以 Tokio 为事实标准中心，形成了分层的依赖关系：底层 IO 抽象（mio、hyper）→ 运行时（Tokio）→ 应用框架（axum、actix-web）→ 数据访问（sqlx、redis-rs）→ 可观测性（tracing）。选择技术栈时，优先选择与 Tokio 深度集成的库，可获得最佳的性能和生态兼容性。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    App[你的应用] --&gt; Framework[axum / actix-web]&#10;    App --&gt; DB[sqlx / sea-orm]&#10;    App --&gt; Tracing[tracing]&#10;    Framework --&gt; Tokio[Tokio 运行时]&#10;    DB --&gt; Tokio&#10;    Tokio --&gt; Mio[mio epoll/kqueue]&#10;    Framework --&gt; Hyper[hyper HTTP]&#10;    Hyper --&gt; Tokio\">graph TD\n    App[你的应用] --&gt; Framework[axum / actix-web]\n    App --&gt; DB[sqlx / sea-orm]\n    App --&gt; Tracing[tracing]\n    Framework --&gt; Tokio[Tokio 运行时]\n    DB --&gt; Tokio\n    Tokio --&gt; Mio[mio epoll/kqueue]\n    Framework --&gt; Hyper[hyper HTTP]\n    Hyper --&gt; Tokio</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生态层</th>\n<th>首选库</th>\n<th>备选库</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运行时</td>\n<td>tokio</td>\n<td>async-std, smol</td>\n<td>生产选 tokio</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP 服务</td>\n<td>axum</td>\n<td>actix-web, poem</td>\n<td>axum 生态最活跃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HTTP 客户端</td>\n<td>reqwest</td>\n<td>hyper（低级）</td>\n<td>reqwest 开箱即用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SQL 数据库</td>\n<td>sqlx</td>\n<td>sea-orm, diesel</td>\n<td>sqlx 编译时检查</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gRPC</td>\n<td>tonic</td>\n<td>无主要备选</td>\n<td>Tokio 官方支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列化</td>\n<td>serde</td>\n<td>无替代</td>\n<td>生态标准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>日志追踪</td>\n<td>tracing</td>\n<td>log（简单场景）</td>\n<td>结构化日志首选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"运行时层对比\">运行时层对比</h2><p>Rust 主流异步运行时的核心对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>运行时</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>调度器</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>Tokio</strong></td>\n<td>生产级通用运行时</td>\n<td>多线程工作窃取</td>\n<td>服务端应用、网络服务、生产系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>async-std</strong></td>\n<td>标准库风格 API</td>\n<td>多线程（类 Tokio）</td>\n<td>期望与 std API 对称的场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>smol</strong></td>\n<td>极简运行时</td>\n<td>可定制</td>\n<td>嵌入式、学习、自定义运行时场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>embassy</strong></td>\n<td>嵌入式异步</td>\n<td>单线程合作式</td>\n<td>STM32/RP2040 等裸机环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>glommio</strong></td>\n<td>io_uring 专属</td>\n<td>单线程 thread-per-core</td>\n<td>高性能存储系统（Linux 5.1+）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Tokio 为何成为主流</strong>：Tokio 具有最广泛的生态支持（绝大多数异步库首选 Tokio）、最活跃的维护（Tokio 团队在 tokio-rs 组织下维护大量配套库）、最丰富的文档和社区资源，以及经过大量生产验证的稳定性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"http-框架生态\">HTTP 框架生态</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Hyper[hyper - HTTP 基础层] --&gt; Axum[axum - Tokio 官方框架]&#10;    Hyper --&gt; Warp[warp - Filter 组合器风格]&#10;    Hyper --&gt; Actix[actix-web - Actor 模型]&#10;    Hyper --&gt; Poem[poem - 简洁 API 设计]&#10;    Hyper --&gt; Salvo[salvo - 中文社区活跃]&#10;&#10;    Reqwest[reqwest HTTP 客户端] --&gt; Hyper\">graph TD\n    Hyper[hyper - HTTP 基础层] --&gt; Axum[axum - Tokio 官方框架]\n    Hyper --&gt; Warp[warp - Filter 组合器风格]\n    Hyper --&gt; Actix[actix-web - Actor 模型]\n    Hyper --&gt; Poem[poem - 简洁 API 设计]\n    Hyper --&gt; Salvo[salvo - 中文社区活跃]\n\n    Reqwest[reqwest HTTP 客户端] --&gt; Hyper</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>框架</th>\n<th>风格</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>学习曲线</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>axum</strong></td>\n<td>路由器 + Handler</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>新项目首选，Tokio 官方推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>actix-web</strong></td>\n<td>Actor + 注解</td>\n<td>极高（历次 TechEmpower 榜首）</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>性能敏感、Actor 模型爱好者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>warp</strong></td>\n<td>Filter 组合器</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>较高</td>\n<td>函数式编程风格偏好者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>poem</strong></td>\n<td>简洁路由</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>快速原型、OpenAPI 生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据库驱动\">数据库驱动</h2><p><strong>sqlx</strong>：目前最受欢迎的异步 SQL 驱动，支持 PostgreSQL、MySQL、SQLite，提供编译时 SQL 检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use sqlx::PgPool;&#10;&#10;// 编译时检查：如果 SQL 语句有误，编译就会报错&#10;let user = sqlx::query!(&#10;    &quot;SELECT id, name, email FROM users WHERE id = $1&quot;,&#10;    user_id&#10;)&#10;.fetch_one(&amp;pool)&#10;.await?;&#10;&#10;// 强类型映射到结构体&#10;#[derive(sqlx::FromRow)]&#10;struct User {&#10;    id: i64,&#10;    name: String,&#10;    email: String,&#10;}&#10;&#10;let user: User = sqlx::query_as!(User,&#10;    &quot;SELECT id, name, email FROM users WHERE id = $1&quot;,&#10;    user_id&#10;).fetch_one(&amp;pool).await?;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use sqlx::PgPool;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译时检查：如果 SQL 语句有误，编译就会报错</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let user = sqlx::query!(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"SELECT id, name, email FROM users WHERE id = $1\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.fetch_one(&#x26;pool)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>.await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 强类型映射到结构体</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(sqlx::FromRow)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct User {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id: i64,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    email: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let user: User = sqlx::query_as!(User,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    \"SELECT id, name, email FROM users WHERE id = $1\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>).fetch_one(&#x26;pool).await?;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库</th>\n<th>数据库支持</th>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>sqlx</strong></td>\n<td>PG/MySQL/SQLite</td>\n<td>编译时检查、宏接口</td>\n<td>主流选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>sea-orm</strong></td>\n<td>PG/MySQL/SQLite</td>\n<td>ActiveRecord 风格 ORM</td>\n<td>需要 ORM 的项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>diesel</strong></td>\n<td>PG/MySQL/SQLite</td>\n<td>同步（有 async-diesel 包装）</td>\n<td>类型安全优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>tokio-postgres</strong></td>\n<td>PostgreSQL 专属</td>\n<td>低级驱动，无 ORM</td>\n<td>极致性能控制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>redis-rs</strong></td>\n<td>Redis</td>\n<td>同步+异步</td>\n<td>Redis 操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>mongodb</strong></td>\n<td>MongoDB</td>\n<td>官方驱动</td>\n<td>MongoDB 项目</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"序列化与网络协议\">序列化与网络协议</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// serde：Rust 生态最核心的序列化框架&#10;use serde::{Serialize, Deserialize};&#10;&#10;#[derive(Serialize, Deserialize)]&#10;struct ApiResponse {&#10;    data: Vec&lt;Item&gt;,&#10;    next_cursor: Option&lt;String&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;// JSON：serde_json&#10;let json = serde_json::to_string(&amp;response)?;&#10;&#10;// MessagePack：rmp-serde（高效二进制格式）&#10;let bytes = rmp_serde::to_vec(&amp;response)?;&#10;&#10;// Protocol Buffers：prost（gRPC 标准格式）&#10;// 通常与 tonic（gRPC 框架）配合使用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// serde：Rust 生态最核心的序列化框架</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use serde::{Serialize, Deserialize};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[derive(Serialize, Deserialize)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct ApiResponse {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data: Vec&#x3C;Item>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    next_cursor: Option&#x3C;String>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// JSON：serde_json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let json = serde_json::to_string(&#x26;response)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// MessagePack：rmp-serde（高效二进制格式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let bytes = rmp_serde::to_vec(&#x26;response)?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Protocol Buffers：prost（gRPC 标准格式）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 通常与 tonic（gRPC 框架）配合使用</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>gRPC 生态</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// tonic：Rust 的 gRPC 实现（基于 Tokio + hyper）&#10;use tonic::{transport::Server, Request, Response, Status};&#10;&#10;#[tonic::async_trait]&#10;impl Greeter for GreeterService {&#10;    async fn say_hello(&#10;        &amp;self,&#10;        request: Request&lt;HelloRequest&gt;,&#10;    ) -&gt; Result&lt;Response&lt;HelloReply&gt;, Status&gt; {&#10;        let reply = HelloReply {&#10;            message: format!(&quot;Hello {}!&quot;, request.into_inner().name),&#10;        };&#10;        Ok(Response::new(reply))&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// tonic：Rust 的 gRPC 实现（基于 Tokio + hyper）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use tonic::{transport::Server, Request, Response, Status};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[tonic::async_trait]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl Greeter for GreeterService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async fn say_hello(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x26;self,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        request: Request&#x3C;HelloRequest>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ) -> Result&#x3C;Response&#x3C;HelloReply>, Status> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let reply = HelloReply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            message: format!(\"Hello {}!\", request.into_inner().name),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        Ok(Response::new(reply))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"消息队列与事件流\">消息队列与事件流</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>库</th>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>特性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>rdkafka</strong></td>\n<td>Apache Kafka</td>\n<td>基于 librdkafka，高吞吐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>lapin</strong></td>\n<td>RabbitMQ/AMQP</td>\n<td>纯 Rust AMQP 客户端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>async-nats</strong></td>\n<td>NATS</td>\n<td>轻量级高性能消息系统</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>rskafka</strong></td>\n<td>Kafka</td>\n<td>纯 Rust 实现，无 C 依赖</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// async-nats 示例&#10;use async_nats;&#10;&#10;let client = async_nats::connect(&quot;nats://localhost:4222&quot;).await?;&#10;&#10;// 发布&#10;client.publish(&quot;orders.created&quot;, payload.into()).await?;&#10;&#10;// 订阅&#10;let mut subscriber = client.subscribe(&quot;orders.*&quot;).await?;&#10;while let Some(message) = subscriber.next().await {&#10;    process_order(message).await;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// async-nats 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use async_nats;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let client = async_nats::connect(\"nats://localhost:4222\").await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 发布</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>client.publish(\"orders.created\", payload.into()).await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 订阅</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let mut subscriber = client.subscribe(\"orders.*\").await?;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>while let Some(message) = subscriber.next().await {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    process_order(message).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"测试工具\">测试工具</h2><p><strong>tokio::test</strong>：Tokio 测试宏，自动创建运行时：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[tokio::test]&#10;async fn test_database_query() {&#10;    let pool = create_test_pool().await;&#10;    let result = query_users(&amp;pool).await;&#10;    assert!(!result.is_empty());&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[tokio::test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn test_database_query() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let pool = create_test_pool().await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result = query_users(&#x26;pool).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assert!(!result.is_empty());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>mockall</strong>：支持异步 trait mock 的测试工具：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use mockall::{automock, predicate};&#10;&#10;#[automock]&#10;#[async_trait::async_trait]&#10;trait UserRepository {&#10;    async fn find_by_id(&amp;self, id: u64) -&gt; Option&lt;User&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;#[tokio::test]&#10;async fn test_user_service() {&#10;    let mut mock_repo = MockUserRepository::new();&#10;    mock_repo.expect_find_by_id()&#10;        .with(predicate::eq(42))&#10;        .returning(|_| Box::pin(async { Some(User { id: 42, name: &quot;Alice&quot;.to_string() }) }));&#10;&#10;    let service = UserService::new(Box::new(mock_repo));&#10;    let user = service.get_user(42).await;&#10;    assert_eq!(user.unwrap().name, &quot;Alice&quot;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use mockall::{automock, predicate};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[automock]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[async_trait::async_trait]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>trait UserRepository {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    async fn find_by_id(&#x26;self, id: u64) -> Option&#x3C;User>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[tokio::test]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn test_user_service() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut mock_repo = MockUserRepository::new();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mock_repo.expect_find_by_id()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .with(predicate::eq(42))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        .returning(|_| Box::pin(async { Some(User { id: 42, name: \"Alice\".to_string() }) }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let service = UserService::new(Box::new(mock_repo));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let user = service.get_user(42).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assert_eq!(user.unwrap().name, \"Alice\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"观测性工具\">观测性工具</h2><p><strong>tracing</strong>：Rust 异步代码的标准结构化日志和追踪框架：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use tracing::{info, instrument};&#10;&#10;// #[instrument] 自动记录函数入口/出口和 span&#10;#[instrument(fields(request_id = %req.id))]&#10;async fn handle_request(req: Request) -&gt; Response {&#10;    info!(&quot;Processing request&quot;);&#10;    let result = process(req).await;&#10;    info!(success = result.is_ok(), &quot;Request completed&quot;);&#10;    result.into_response()&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use tracing::{info, instrument};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// #[instrument] 自动记录函数入口/出口和 span</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[instrument(fields(request_id = %req.id))]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async fn handle_request(req: Request) -> Response {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    info!(\"Processing request\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result = process(req).await;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    info!(success = result.is_ok(), \"Request completed\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result.into_response()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Tokio Console 是专门为异步 Rust 设计的调试工具，可以实时查看任务调度、等待时间和阻塞点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[dependencies]&#10;console-subscriber = &quot;0.1&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console-subscriber = \"0.1\"</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 在 main.rs 中启用&#10;console_subscriber::init();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 在 main.rs 中启用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console_subscriber::init();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>启动后可以用 <code>tokio-console</code> 命令查看实时的任务状态，这对排查死锁、阻塞和性能问题非常有价值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"技术选型建议\">技术选型建议</h2><p>典型 Web 服务技术栈：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[dependencies]&#10;# 运行时&#10;tokio = { version = &quot;1&quot;, features = [&quot;full&quot;] }&#10;&#10;# HTTP 服务&#10;axum = &quot;0.7&quot;&#10;tower = &quot;0.4&quot;          # 中间件生态&#10;tower-http = &quot;0.5&quot;     # HTTP 特定中间件&#10;&#10;# 数据库&#10;sqlx = { version = &quot;0.7&quot;, features = [&quot;postgres&quot;, &quot;runtime-tokio&quot;] }&#10;&#10;# 序列化&#10;serde = { version = &quot;1&quot;, features = [&quot;derive&quot;] }&#10;serde_json = &quot;1&quot;&#10;&#10;# 错误处理&#10;anyhow = &quot;1&quot;           # 应用层错误&#10;thiserror = &quot;1&quot;        # 库错误定义&#10;&#10;# 日志追踪&#10;tracing = &quot;0.1&quot;&#10;tracing-subscriber = &quot;0.3&quot;&#10;&#10;# HTTP 客户端&#10;reqwest = { version = &quot;0.11&quot;, features = [&quot;json&quot;] }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[dependencies]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 运行时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tokio = { version = \"1\", features = [\"full\"] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># HTTP 服务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>axum = \"0.7\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tower = \"0.4\"          # 中间件生态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tower-http = \"0.5\"     # HTTP 特定中间件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 数据库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sqlx = { version = \"0.7\", features = [\"postgres\", \"runtime-tokio\"] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 序列化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>serde = { version = \"1\", features = [\"derive\"] }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>serde_json = \"1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 错误处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>anyhow = \"1\"           # 应用层错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>thiserror = \"1\"        # 库错误定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 日志追踪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tracing = \"0.1\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tracing-subscriber = \"0.3\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># HTTP 客户端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>reqwest = { version = \"0.11\", features = [\"json\"] }</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p>参见本章节：<a href=\"runtime-agnostic-design\">运行时无关设计</a> — 库代码如何在多运行时之间保持兼容；<a href=\"pin-and-self-referential\">Pin 与自引用结构</a> — 生态工具（pin-project 等）的工作原理。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Rust 异步生态已经相当成熟，以下是关键要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Tokio 是事实标准</strong>：绝大多数异步库优先支持 Tokio，新项目选 Tokio 可获得最完整的生态兼容性</li>\n<li><strong>标准技术栈</strong>：Tokio（运行时）+ axum（HTTP 框架）+ sqlx（数据库）+ serde（序列化）+ tracing（可观测性）</li>\n<li><strong>分层理解</strong>：了解 mio、hyper、futures 等底层组件有助于在遇到特殊需求时找到正确的抽象层</li>\n<li><strong>跨运行时兼容</strong>：库代码应使用 <code>futures</code> crate 提供的公共接口，而非直接绑定 Tokio 专属 API</li>\n<li><strong>tokio-util 桥接</strong>：当需要连接 Tokio 专属类型和通用 futures trait 时，<code>tokio-util</code> 提供了必要的适配器</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"异步生态系统：Rust 异步编程的工具全景","id":"异步生态系统-rust-异步编程的工具全景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"运行时层对比","id":"运行时层对比"},{"level":2,"text":"HTTP 框架生态","id":"http-框架生态"},{"level":2,"text":"数据库驱动","id":"数据库驱动"},{"level":2,"text":"序列化与网络协议","id":"序列化与网络协议"},{"level":2,"text":"消息队列与事件流","id":"消息队列与事件流"},{"level":2,"text":"测试工具","id":"测试工具"},{"level":2,"text":"观测性工具","id":"观测性工具"},{"level":2,"text":"技术选型建议","id":"技术选型建议"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"运行时无关设计：编写可移植的异步库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-async-runtime/advanced/runtime-agnostic-design"},"next":null}